  "grace|There's a little round hole in the side. Like somebody took a bite.": "6514c7baef2d1674",
  "deedee|And somebody left a burnt light bulb. Now they're littering at my pond too.": "61c9b9c17220211c",
  "deedee|The tin. Go, go, go.": "b90897df9f7d0702",
  "rose|Bye, marble. I'm coming back for you.": "327662f31179267b",
  "tom|That's a fish. That fish is bigger than the cab.": "693c26779eae11eb",
  "grace|Boppy was RIGHT?": "67dcdfb686ce795b",
  "deedee|Nobody tell him.": "0ad6fef0d14e1a83",
  "bigone|This morning I was a fish. Then there was a big flash. Now I am a BIG fish. With a hat.": "f9da894df3e76521",
  "deedee|Tom, you stand in front of whoever it stares at. Cozy Rosie, make it laugh. Then we try again.": "be89369cba5908e2",
  "bigone|And this is for the small one. It's my shiniest thing.": "500dadc11663aad5",
  "rose|It has a bug on it! I'm keeping it.": "fb624ead7712dc58",
  "tom|This one you can keep.": "96319b34550c6813",
  "bigone|The old man with the cap. Is he coming tomorrow?": "c5f59d570c6289fd",
  "grace|Boppy? He comes every day.": "305829362ca6986b",
  "bigone|Good. Don't tell him I asked.": "4be46db26859522e",
  "grace|Boppy, the mud TALKED. And the mosquitoes. And a puddle.": "1ea52ca8c1340463",
  "boppy|The mud talked? Forty years in this town, the mud never said one word to me.": "fb185efb171ffcdc",
  "rose|He gave me a present. Look.": "1c9c26167620511d",
  "boppy|That's real gold, Cozy Rosie. Gold like my teeth. Look.": "c86d577059f3a08a",
  "rose|Boppy has treasure in his mouth!": "9e2764a468d01226",
