  "tom|Something strange happened on Long Island too. A blob of mud with eyes climbed in my mother's kitchen window and ran off with her rhubarb crisp.": "",
  "tnb|The mud took Deedee's crisp? Is the mud okay?": "",
  "tom|We chased it to the pond. And there was a talking fish as big as a car, wearing her baking tin like a crown.": "",
  "tnb|A talking fish! What did he say?": "",
  "tom|He said \"Glub.\" Then he gave Rose a gold coin.": "",
  "tnb|Mud in the kitchen, a talking fish, and now a purple sky. Babe, something fishy is going on.": "",
  "tom|The fish was the nicest part!": "",
  "tom|I want to go look at that sky with you. But first I have to feed Bready Mercury. He's been alone for a week.": "",
  "tnb|He hasn't been alone. Come on, I'll show you.": "",
  "tnb|So I stayed here with her. I was coming over anyway. I've been feeding Bready Mercury every day.": "",
  "tom|Every day? Fifty grams of flour and fifty grams of water?": "",
  "tnb|Fifty and fifty. I used your little scale.": "",
  "tnb|He got so big he was climbing out of the jar. So I baked a loaf with him.": "",
  "tom|It's perfectly round! How did you get it so round?": "",
  "tnb|I shaped it on my pottery wheel.": "",
  "tom|On the pottery wheel! That's brilliant. Why have I been doing it with my hands?": "",
  "tnb|I make bowls all day, babe. So I made you a bread bowl.": "",
  "tom|A bread bowl! Now we need soup.": "",
  "tom|Nara, sit.": "",
  "tom|Paw.": "",
  "tom|He's twice as big as when I left! What have you been doing with him?": "",
  "tnb|I sing to him while I stir. He's Bready Mercury. He needs his music.": "",
  "tom|Which songs?": "",
  "tnb|\"Another One Bites the Crust.\"": "",
  "tom|\"Don't Stop Me Dough!\"": "",
  "tnb|Babe. That's so good. I'm singing that one tomorrow.": "",
  "tom|That's the same purple as the sky! An hour ago it was way up on the hill. Now it's on my lawn!": "",
  "tom|Mr. Washington is sitting out on his porch in that. Come on!": "",
  "tom|What happened in 1979?": "",
  "tom|He just said the same thing again, word for word.": "",
  "tnb|He always finishes that story. I've heard it nine times. It ends with gumbo.": "",
  "tom|It's not a nice afternoon, Mr. Washington! The air is purple!": "",
  "tnb|Babe. That cloud has a face. And it just talked to us.": "",
  "tom|It's like the mud at my mother's house! I told you they talk!": "",
  "tnb|You did tell me. It's a lot scarier in person.": "",
  "tom|The man in the mask jumped out! I jumped higher!": "",
  "tnb|And it rained popcorn on the whole room. Let's do that to these clouds.": "",
  "tom|I don't have any popcorn!": "",
  "tnb|You don't need popcorn. You just need to be that scared.": "",
  "tom|Oh, I'm that scared.": "",
  "tom|That doesn't sound like him at all. He tells me how old he is every single morning. He's proud of it!": "",
  "tnb|If the smog did this to him, what about everybody on the boulevard?": "",
  "tom|Miss Odette and Doña Carmen! Come on!": "",
  "tnb|Miss Odette, it's me! Can I get a bowl of gumbo?": "",
  "tnb|Babe, this is bad. Every time I walk in here she yells \"Sit down, you're too skinny!\" before the door even closes.": "",
  "tom|Miss Odette? I'm sorry to bother you. TNB is standing up, and he's very skinny today.": "",
  "tom|Nothing. She's just like Mr. Washington.": "",
  "tnb|Babe, the pupusas are burning!": "",
  "tom|Doña Carmen, I'm so sorry. I'm coming behind your counter. I know nobody's allowed back here.": "",
  "tom|I flipped them. I'm ready for the towel. Go ahead.": "",
  "tnb|She smacks you with that towel if you even look at the griddle.": "",
  "tom|I know! I've never wanted to be hit with a towel so badly!": "",
  "tom|The parking tickets can TALK now? They were bad enough when they were quiet!": "",
  "tom|And I moved my car on Monday night! I set two alarms!": "",
  "tom|Fine. Can I pay it in SkyMiles?": "",
  "tom|Excuse me! She is not a snack. She is our guest!": "",
  "tnb|We do have snacks, though. I've got half a bag of gummy worms.": "",
  "grump|Coyotes don't eat gummy worms.": "",
  "tnb|Babe, look at that tree. It's grey. The leaves, the trunk, even the dirt. It looks like an old black and white movie.": "",
  "tom|There's one lemon on it. And the lemon is inside a block of something orange.": "",
  "tom|I've seen this before. There's one exactly like it at my parents' pond, with a dragonfly inside.": "",
  "tnb|On Long Island? Babe, that's three thousand miles away.": "",
  "tom|Two thousand four hundred and seventy-five.": "",
  "tnb|It's not glass, and it's not glaze. I work with this kind of stuff all day and I have no idea what it is.": "",
  "tnb|There's a little round hole in the side, like somebody took a bite out of it.": "",
  "tom|The one at the pond has the same hole. And you can't pull it off. Rose tried, and then I tried.": "",
  "tnb|Can I try anyway?": "",
  "tnb|Okay. Wow. Your turn.": "",
  "tom|I already lost to the small one. ...Maybe it's easier in California.": "",
  "tom|It's not easier in California.": "",
  "tom|It's a burnt-out flashbulb. My mother found one exactly like it next to the dragonfly.": "",
  "tnb|Who leaves the same bulb at a pond in New York and on a hill in Los Angeles?": "",
  "tom|I don't know. And I really don't like it.": "",
  "tnb|Me neither. And I like almost everything.": "",
  "tom|That hill has EYES! The whole hill just stood up!": "",
  "tnb|Babe. I take naps on that hill.": "",
  "tom|I think you've been napping on his face!": "",
  "tnb|I'm so sorry, sir!": "",
  "bigone|RUMBLE. There was a big flash up here this morning, and it woke me up.": "",
  "bigone|A million years under this city, and everybody up top is always leaving. Today nobody leaves. Not ever.": "",
  "tnb|He'd know. He has four hundred and twelve thousand miles.": "",
  "tnb|I'm sorry I kept falling asleep on you. I didn't know you were a person.": "",
  "bigone|I liked the naps. You were the only one who ever stayed.": "",
  "bigone|Something shiny has been stuck in my pipe all day. It tickles. Ah... ah... A-CHOO!": "",
  "tom|It's a gold coin with a lemon on it. Rose's has a dragonfly.": "",
  "tnb|The one the fish gave her?": "",
  "tom|Yes. A fish gave her one, and now a hill sneezed one at me.": "",
  "tnb|Nara thinks it's a very small frisbee.": "",
  "tom|Nara, I'm sorry. We don't play fetch with gold.": "",
  "tom|The hill said a flash woke it up this morning. The fish at the pond said the same thing.": "",
  "tnb|Two flashes, two orange blocks and two gold coins. Babe, I don't love that. Let's go check on Mr. Washington.": "",
  "tnb|That's ten times now. It gets better every time.": "",
  "odette|I brought gumbo for the whole block. TNB! Sit DOWN. You're too skinny!": "",
  "tnb|Yes, ma'am!": "",
  "carmen|And YOU. Who went behind my counter?": "",
  "tom|Thank you, Doña Carmen! That's the best towel I've ever been hit with!": "",
  "carmen|They came out perfectly crispy. Don't ever do it again.": "",
  "tnb|Babe. Gumbo. Go get the bread bowl!": "",
  "tom|It has a hole in the top. I gave that piece to Nara.": "",
  "tnb|That's not a hole. That's where the gumbo goes in.": "",
  "tnb|With two thousand four hundred and seventy-five miles in between.": "",
  "tom|Each way. That's a lot of SkyMiles.": ""
